{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_0196znWXpWV4ei2mdc74vxAr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task 16 is complete. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **`config_schema.py`** - Added `skip_planning_for: List[str]` field to `AgentPipelineConfig` with default `[\"lint\", \"todo\"]`\n\n2. **`agent_pipeline.py`** - In `run()`, added logic before the planner step that checks if all task sources are in `skip_planning_for`. When skipped:\n   - The planner agent is not invoked (saving one Claude API call)\n   - `plan_text` is set to the task description directly\n   - No rollback is needed (planner didn't run)\n   - A log message indicates which task types triggered the skip\n\n3. **`tests/test_agent_pipeline.py`** - Added `TestSkipPlanningFor` class with 4 tests:\n   - `test_skip_planner_for_lint_task` - verifies planner is skipped for lint tasks\n   - `test_planner_runs_for_non_skip_task` - verifies planner runs for test_failure tasks\n   - `test_mixed_sources_runs_planner` - verifies planner runs when tasks have mixed sources\n   - `test_empty_skip_list_runs_planner` - verifies planner runs when skip list is empty\n\nAll 939 tests pass."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":259,"cache_read_input_tokens":64323,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":259,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8d82d89c-1e3e-44f1-8b61-542209a31f5e","uuid":"75cbb424-8252-4d9a-b07f-ba4c510ad0dc"}
