{"type":"system","subtype":"hook_response","hook_id":"5b334fc6-ef18-4c58-9ca5-55719f4ea5b3","hook_name":"SessionStart:startup","hook_event":"SessionStart","output":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"SessionStart\",\"additionalContext\":\"<available_skills>\\nThe following skill files are available for this codebase. To load a skill, use the Read tool to read the file path. Do NOT use the built-in Skill tool for the skills listed here - these are file-based skills that must be read directly.\\n\\n  <skill>\\n    <path>/opt/facebook/claude-templates-cli/components/skills/chief-wiggum/SKILL.md</path>\\n    <description>Generates boilerplate files for ralph loops - an LLM-driven methodology using iterative Claude Code sessions. Creates spec.md, prompt.md, run.sh, and context.md that the user runs OUTSIDE of Claude. Performs deep codebase research to inform task breakdown. Does NOT execute the loop - only sets it up. Use when user wants to create ralph loop scaffolding, generate ralph loop files, or prepare a task list for non-interactive Claude execution. Works best with the `deep-research` skill installed.</description>\\n  </skill>\\n</available_skills>\"},\"systemMessage\":\"Discovered 1 skill (/llm-rules-info for more)\"}","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"SessionStart\",\"additionalContext\":\"<available_skills>\\nThe following skill files are available for this codebase. To load a skill, use the Read tool to read the file path. Do NOT use the built-in Skill tool for the skills listed here - these are file-based skills that must be read directly.\\n\\n  <skill>\\n    <path>/opt/facebook/claude-templates-cli/components/skills/chief-wiggum/SKILL.md</path>\\n    <description>Generates boilerplate files for ralph loops - an LLM-driven methodology using iterative Claude Code sessions. Creates spec.md, prompt.md, run.sh, and context.md that the user runs OUTSIDE of Claude. Performs deep codebase research to inform task breakdown. Does NOT 