{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01PwexmPXbtj5MGhboob9kB1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task 23 is complete. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n**Task 23**: Added 12 tests for `GracefulDegradation` in `tests/test_safety.py`\n\n**Tests added** (`TestGracefulDegradation` class):\n- `test_normal_level_below_70` — verifies level 0 at 69% (batch_size_factor=1.0, sleep_multiplier=1.0)\n- `test_mild_level_at_70` — verifies level 1 at exactly 70% (batch_size_factor=0.75, sleep_multiplier=2.0)\n- `test_moderate_level_at_85` — verifies level 2 at exactly 85% (batch_size_factor=0.5, sleep_multiplier=3.0)\n- `test_severe_level_at_95` — verifies level 3 at exactly 95% (batch_size_factor=0.25, sleep_multiplier=4.0)\n- `test_boundary_69_is_normal` — 69% with both rate and cost stays normal\n- `test_boundary_84_is_mild` — 84% stays mild (not moderate)\n- `test_boundary_94_is_moderate` — 94% stays moderate (not severe)\n- `test_cost_driven_degradation` — cost alone can trigger severe\n- `test_max_of_rate_and_cost` — higher of the two percentages determines level\n- `test_reason_includes_both_when_both_above_70` — reason string mentions both rate and cost\n- `test_recovery_from_degraded_to_normal` — state resets when usage drops\n\nAll 978 tests pass."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":36841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":255,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c65566fb-ead9-49f5-afe9-3b595f066c68","uuid":"790722f2-e7ff-4cd4-a75b-704bf3637402"}
